  "question_text": "You are analyzing moderation activity on a platform to understand how effectively reported posts are being reviewed and removed.\r\n\r\nYou are given two datasets:\r\n\r\n- **user_actions** \u2013 captures user activity such as reporting posts\r\n- **post_removals** \u2013 records posts removed by reviewers\r\n\r\nCalculate the **daily post removal ratio**, defined as the number of posts removed on a day divided by the number of unique posts reported on that day.\r\n\r\n**Input DataFrames:** `user_actions`, `post_removals`\r\n\r\n**user_actions**\r\n\r\n| Column  | Type           |\r\n| ------- | -------------- |\r\n| user_id | int64          |\r\n| date    | datetime64[ns] |\r\n| post_id | int64          |\r\n| action  | object         |\r\n| details | object         |\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary style=\"padding:8px 16px; background-color:#2196F3; color:white; border-radius:4px; cursor:pointer; display:inline-block; list-style:none;\">Preview user_actions</summary>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n|user\\_id|date|post\\_id|action|details|\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n|302|2024-01-17|5301|share||\r\n|211|2024-01-16|5210|like||\r\n|107|2024-01-15|5106|comment|interesting|\r\n|208|2024-01-16|5207|like||\r\n|513|2024-01-19|5512|like||\r\n|214|2024-01-16|5213|comment|agree|\r\n|415|2024-01-18|5414|share||\r\n|102|2024-01-15|5101|share||\r\n|215|2024-01-16|5214|share||\r\n|515|2024-01-19|5514|share||\r\n|102|2024-01-15|5001|report|spam|\r\n|106|2024-01-15|5105|share||\r\n|105|2024-01-15|5104|like||\r\n|510|2024-01-19|5043|report|spam|\r\n|115|2024-01-15|5114|like||\r\n|213|2024-01-16|5212|like||\r\n|402|2024-01-18|5401|share||\r\n|502|2024-01-19|5037|report|spam|\r\n|101|2024-01-15|5100|like||\r\n|410|2024-01-18|5034|report|spam|\r\n|202|2024-01-16|5201|share||\r\n|309|2024-01-17|5308|like||\r\n|204|2024-01-16|5203|like||\r\n|104|2024-01-15|5103|like||\r\n|108|2024-01-15|5107|like||\r\n|401|2024-01-18|5400|like||\r\n|505|2024-01-19|5039|report|spam|\r\n|503|2024-01-